cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "marEx: Scalable Detection and Tracking of Weather & Climate Extremes"
abstract: "A Python framework to detect and track weather and climate extremes at scale, on regular grids and unstructured meshes. It has three stages, each usable on its own: climatologies and anomalies, percentile-based extreme identification, and event tracking through time with merging and splitting. It applies to ocean, atmosphere, land surface and biogeochemical variables on regular grids and unstructured meshes."
